WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,850
Miss Youyou, this is it

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:07,140
Uncle, don’t you all like the local specialties from Youyoudai?

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:10,140
After I reported the matter of Youyou bringing souvenirs to the old man and the old lady,

4
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:13,140
The two of them disliked the fact that the things she brought from the countryside contained bacteria.

5
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:15,140
Sent a servant to deliver it to the warehouse

6
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:18,140
It's because everyone is too busy and haven't had time to open the gifts yet

7
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,140
It just so happens that Miss Youyou is here to distribute it.

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,140
Who are these gifts for?

9
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:28,240
Okay, uncle, I’ll give this to you.

10
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,240
This is a gold bar, little lady

11
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,240
Isn’t that right? Whose souvenir is gold bars?

12
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:35,240
Uncle, do you think I look like your long-lost biological sister?

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:39,240
I accept the gold bars with a smile, I accept the charm with a smile, I accept the black land with a smile, quack

14
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,240
It doesn't matter, there are many yo-yo-yo

15
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,240
No, this is too expensive

16
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,240
Miss, I can't accept it

17
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:48,240
Say thank you and put it in your hand, say don’t put it in your pocket

18
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:53,300
Even at such an old age, he was given money by a young lady again

19
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:59,820
Little miss, this, this, this is the job of the Imperial Law Bandit Cui.

20
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:03,820
I have been with my family for many years and have seen a lot of good things.

21
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:06,820
Even if this class paper is placed in Mr. Pei's collection,

22
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,020
It’s also a top-quality treasure

23
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:11,020
The little lady just gave it to me so beautifully.

24
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:15,350
They all bid farewell to uncle
